Hi Robert,

I've attached the briefing (BCE-CE-2026-BRF-006-R00) and the separate allocat=
ion workbook (BCE-CE-2026-TBL-010-R00) for Thursday, August 13, at 10 a.m. Co=
uld you choose which of the two $38,000 allocations we should carry into the =
next application?

I recommend working within our existing reader capacity and using the $12,000=
 expansion allowance for the low-range follow-up and the associated records r=
eview. In the workbook that adds $10,000 to low-range evaluation and $2,000 t=
o records review. Joseph can walk through the estimates he checked yesterday =
and explain why the $2,000 is on the Bennett records-review line. It covers 2=
5 hours of internal review, separate from Caldwell's supplemental service pac=
kage.

Thanks,
Melissa

